{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/fourmiworldlogo.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 &quot;In times of boredom, there's only one logical thing to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ...travel to another dimension, recreationally!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/wandereye.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <i>- A. Wandereye (probably)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fourmiworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fourmiworld</strong> is all about exploring a strange world orbiting a dying star. Along the way you'll discover the remains of a lost civilization, encounter bizarre creatures, unearth tools to aid your excavation, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/YouReallyCheckedThisFileOutHuh.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/teaser_1_gif-export.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Should you play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you <strong>enjoy at least 7 of the following points</strong>, we think you'll really click with <strong>Fourmiworld</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games with <strong>destructible environments</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> to discover.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-world <strong>exploration</strong> and<strong> nonlinear</strong> progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insects</strong>, bugs and Sci-Fi <strong>ecosystems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Piecing together the <strong>history</strong> of a long-gone <strong>alien race.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atypical artstyles</strong>, collage, <strong>girls</strong> with flowers for eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Growing stronger</strong> and gaining <strong>abilities</strong> to better navigate your environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games that <strong>don't hold your hand</strong> and just let you<strong> figure things out.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric</strong>, ambient <strong>music that adapts</strong> to where you are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personalized</strong> experiences, seeing things other players <strong>will not see.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The word &quot;Frondosity&quot; invokes a certain joy in you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/DontWorryMeToo.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/teaser_2_gif-export.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspirations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These games <strong>inspired us</strong> a lot during development. We think you should give the game a try if you <strong>enjoy at least two of these:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metroid - </strong>Game-altering upgrades &amp; lonesome alien atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Terraria - </strong>Digging anywhere &amp; obtaining resources to get new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hylics - </strong>Surrealistic stylization &amp; unconventional vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yume Nikki - </strong>Exploring exactly how you want to &amp; seeing weird/cool/scary things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Starseed Pilgrim - </strong>Lack of hand-holding &amp; tile interaction aspects.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747140?t=1747956405","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/f42fda99a9c68e80e0be793b68a4656a541479a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747956405","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/14089c19e9ac4bcd7e70546e9396d3ab48ebef5c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747956405","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/14089c19e9ac4bcd7e70546e9396d3ab48ebef5c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747956405","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/fourmiworldlogo.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 &quot;In times of boredom, there's only one logical thing to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ...travel to another dimension, recreationally!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/wandereye.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <i>- A. Wandereye (probably)</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fourmiworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fourmiworld</strong> is all about exploring a strange world orbiting a dying star. Along the way you'll discover the remains of a lost civilization, encounter bizarre creatures, unearth tools to aid your excavation, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/YouReallyCheckedThisFileOutHuh.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747140/extras/teaser_1_gif-export.gif?t=1747956405\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Should you play?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you <strong>enjoy at least 7 of the following points</strong>, we think you'll really click with <strong>Fourmiworld</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Games with <strong>destructible environments</strong> and <strong>secrets</strong> to discover.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open-world <strong>exploration</strong> and<strong> nonlinear</strong> progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Insects</strong>, bugs and Sci-Fi <strong>ecosystems.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"b